## Java

*.class
*.war
*.ear
hs_err_pid*

## Signing keystores - NEVER commit these, losing/leaking them is catastrophic
## (a leaked keystore lets anyone publish fake updates to the real app; a lost
## one means the app can never be updated again under the same store listing)
*.keystore
*.jks
!android/debug.keystore

